msgid ""
"Clarity counts bot sessions with the rest. Duct takes them out before it works out any rate."
msgstr ""
"Clarity zählt Bot-Sitzungen mit den anderen. Duct entfernt sie, bevor es eine Rate berechnet."

#: integrations/microsoft-clarity.html
msgid "Clarity keeps three days."
msgstr "Clarity speichert drei Tage."

#: integrations/microsoft-clarity.html
msgid "Clarity landing-page friction"
msgstr "Clarity Landingpage-Reibung"

